d it's rolled. I have the goblin/initiative d20s already on record from my last message    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[14;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (Mira 10, Thorn 15, Pip 23, Gob1 18, Gob2 13, Gob3 8 \u2192 order \u001b[1mPip, Gob1, Thorn, Gob2, Mira,       \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[1mGob3\u001b[22m), but a fresh 2d4+2 needs a real roll.                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[16;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[17;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Two things I need from you:                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[18;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 1. \u001b[1mSay \"retry the dice tool\"\u001b[22m and I'll resubmit it \u2014 the only remaining blocker was a bad         \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[19;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007    hard-coded check expectation (my own xorshift gives \u001b[38;5;6m2d6 \u2192 [5, 6] = 11\u001b[39m, not my guessed \u001b[38;5;6m[3, 5]  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[20;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007    \u001b[38;5;6m= 8\u001b[39m); everything else about it is working. Once it's live, 2d4+2 will take one call.          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2"]
[135.8901, "o", "1;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 2. Or \u001b[1mjust tell me your 2d4 roll\u001b[22m (or the total) and I'll apply the heal immediately.             \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[23;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Potion applied for reference: 2d4+2 ranges 4\u201310, so Mira lands somewhere between 9/14 and 14/14  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[24;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (capped). Say the word and I'll set it.                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[25;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[26;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Also still open from earlier: do you want the three goblins added to the tracker (as HP-only     \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[27;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 entries) so I can log damage to them, and do you want spell slots / death saves tracked for      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[28;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Mira?                                                                                            \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[29;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[1myou> A giant spider bites Pip: poisoned until the end of round 3, and we're in round 1. 