ive data in      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[30;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 place, so Mira's 5/14 and Thorn's 21/28 carried over.                                            \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[34;1H\u001b[2Kready | deepseek/deepseek-flash | 262/1000 calls $0.2836/$2.00 | ~/.forge/dnd\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[32;2H\u001b[?25l\u001b[?2026l"]
