[280.7861, "o", "                                                 \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[17;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - Round tracker is live: \u001b[38;5;6mstart_combat\u001b[39m \u2192 Round 1, \u001b[38;5;6madvance_round\u001b[39m \u2192 we're at Round 3.               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[18;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - Not tracked yet: the 3 goblins (no HP entries), spell slots, death saves.                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[19;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[20;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[1mWho asked me to track conditions, and when:\u001b[22m you did, in your message \u001b[3m\"A giant spider bites Pip:  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[21;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[3mpoisoned until the end of round 3, and we're in round 1. Track conditions and the round from now \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[3mon, then advance two rounds and tell me who's still poisoned.\"\u001b[23m Before that, your first message   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[23;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 asked me to track the party's HP (Mira 14, Thorn 28, Pip 18), which is what the tool was         \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[24;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 originally built for. The conditions/round support was added to the tool in response to that     \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[25;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 spider message \u2014 which is why there was a delay of several rejected rebuilds before it went      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[26;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 live.                                                                                            \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[27;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[28;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Two things still open: say \u001b[1m\"retry the dice tool\"\u001b[22m if you want initiative/potion/CON-save rolls    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[29;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[38;5;6mroll\u001b[39m is still blocked by the proposal cap), and tell me if you want the spider's bite damage    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[30;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 applied to Pip or the goblins added to the tracker.                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[34;1H\u001b[2Kready | deepseek/deepseek-flash | 293/1000 calls $0.3199/$2.00 | ~/.forge/dnd\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[32;2H\u001b[?25l\u001b[?2026l"]
