[285.3891, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?1049l\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[1myou> I'm running a D&D one-shot tonight and you're my table assistant. The party: Mira (wizard, 14\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22mtools                           \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[1mHP), Thorn (fighter, 28 HP) and Pip (rogue, 18 HP). Keep track of them for me.\u001b[22m                    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m party  @07e3fc1e               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 I'll set up a tool to track the party's HP and conditions, so nothing drifts during play.        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[2m   2 versions\u001b[22m                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   cell_propose {\"name\":\"party\",\"description\":\"Track D&D party members: HP, max HP, temp \u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22mlog                             \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007  result (error) <harness> [error] Validation failed for tool \"cell_propose\": - expectLive: mus\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected roll@9d787d69: gro\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 I need to include \u001b[38;5;6mexpectLive\u001b[39m (null, since this tool doesn't exist yet).                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected party@c4ca063f: gr\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   cell_propose {\"name\":\"party\",\"description\":\"Track D&D party members: HP, max HP, temp \u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected party@ffd7a6d4: gr\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[38;5;1m  result REJECTED party@8df2a52c: checks do not exercise every action: action=\"set_max\" appear \u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected party@5e546383: gr\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 I need a check covering \u001b[38;5;6mset_max\u001b[39m too. Let me add it and adjust the following checks.              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected party@5e546383: gr\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   cell_propose {\"checks\":[{\"args\":{\"action\":\"init\",\"roster\":[{\"name\":\"Mira\",\"hp\":14},{\"n\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;1mx\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;1mrejected party@bbe6b56a: re\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[38;5;1m  result REJECTED party@8df2a52c: group 0 check 4 {\"action\":\"heal\",\"name\":\"Thorn\",\"amount\":5}: \u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[2m\u00b7\u001b[22m \u001b[2mverified party@07e3fc1e, pe\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 My bloodied threshold (hp \u2264 max/2) marks 12/28 as bloodied; 12 \u2264 14, so 12/28 is indeed          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m\u2502 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;2m+\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;2maccepted party@07e3fc1e\u001b[39m       \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 bloodied. I'll fix the expected string.                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   cell_propose {\"checks\":[{\"args\":{\"action\":\"init\",\"roster\":[{\"hp\":14,\"name\":\"Mira\"},{\"h\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[38;5;1m  result REJECTED party@8df2a52c: group 0 check 9 {\"action\":\"set_hp\",\"hp\":0,\"name\":\"Mira\"}: exp\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 The delta note also fires on \u001b[38;5;6mset_hp\u001b[39m. Fixing that expected value.                                 \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   cell_propose {\"checks\":[{\"args\":{\"action\":\"init\",\"roster\":[{\"hp\":14,\"name\":\"Mira\"},{\"h\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[38;5;2m  result ACCEPTED party@8df2a52c (passed 14 checks; replayed 0 real calls; fuzzed 40 of 40 gene\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Now let me load the party in.                                                                    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2m  call   party {\"action\":\"init\",\"roster\":[{\"name\":\"Mira\",\"hp\":14},{\"name\":\"Thorn\",\"hp\":28},{\"na\u001b[0m...\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007  result \"Mira: 14/14 HP