[285.3894, "o", "horn: 28/28 HP\\nPip: 18/18 HP\"                                         \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Party's loaded and I've got a tracker tool for the night.                                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[1mRoster\u001b[22m                                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - Mira (wizard): 14/14 HP                                                                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - Thorn (fighter): 28/28 HP                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - Pip (rogue): 18/18 HP                                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Just tell me what happens and I'll keep it straight \u2014 e.g. \"Thorn takes 9\", \"Pip is poisoned\",   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \"Mira heals 5\". The tool handles absent players by name (case-insensitive), never drops anyone   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 below 0 HP, marks anyone at half HP or less as \u001b[1m(bloodied)\u001b[22m and anyone at 0 as \u001b[1m\u001b[1mDOWN\u001b[22m\u001b[22m, and tracks    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 temporary HP (absorbed before real HP) and conditions (poisoned, prone, etc. \u2014 clear them when   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 they wear off).                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 Two things that will matter later:                                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - I assumed each character's listed HP is also their max. If any of them has a different max (or \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007   a CON bump, temp HP, or a different HP on the sheet), tell me and I'll correct it.             \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007 - I don't track death saves or spell slots yet. Say the word and I'll add them.                  \u001b[0m\